NOT OURS TO LICENSE — the candidate lists

  candidates/

  Fifty-one word lists that came from elsewhere. They are the questions this project
  asks, not its answers: a candidate is a word to go looking for, and what earns it a
  place in a shipped list is evidence recorded in a blinkered-dictionary-* repository.
  Each keeps its own terms, stated in candidates/<tag>/LICENSE with its sources in
  candidates/<tag>/PROVENANCE.md. They are not Apache-2.0 and they are not CC0, and
  several are share-alike, which cannot be relicensed by us at all:

